{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49937","headline":"促拍满路花 · 吕岩","name":"促拍满路花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西风吹渭水，落叶满长安。\n茫茫尘世里，独清闲。\n自然鑪鼎，虎绕与龙盘。\n九转丹砂就，一粒刀圭，便成陆地神仙。\n任万钉宝带貂蝉，富贵欲熏天。\n黄粱炊未熟，梦惊残。\n是非海里，直道作人难。\n袖手江南去，白苹红蓼，又寻湓浦庐山。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49937.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49937","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}